---
// src/pages/index.astro
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>GeoMetrics — AI Search Visibility Benchmarks</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Independent GEO and AI search visibility benchmarks across ChatGPT, Perplexity, Claude, Gemini, and Google AI Overviews."
    />
    <!-- Monochrome Geometric 'G' Favicon -->
    <link
      rel="icon"
      type="image/svg+xml"
      href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 32 32'%3E%3Crect width='32' height='32' rx='8' fill='%23111827'/%3E%3Ctext x='50%25' y='54%25' dominant-baseline='middle' text-anchor='middle' fill='%23ffffff' font-family='-apple-system, sans-serif' font-size='18' font-weight='700'%3EG%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E"
    />

    <!-- FAQPage Schema -->
    <script type="application/ld+json">
      {
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
        "mainEntity": [
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "How is AI visibility tracking different from Google SEO?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "Google shows a fixed list of 10 blue links. AI engines write a fresh answer every time, weaving brand names into conversational recommendations. AI visibility tracking measures whether you get mentioned at all, how consistently you appear, and where you rank against competitors inside those answers."
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Which AI engines does GeoMetrics benchmark?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "We track brand visibility across ChatGPT, Perplexity, Claude, Google Gemini, and Google AI Overviews."
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Do you also sell GEO or SEO optimization services?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "No. GeoMetrics is strictly an independent measurement service. We give you accurate ground-truth numbers on where your brand stands without trying to upsell agency retainers."
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "How often do AI search answers change?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "Much faster than traditional search. Model updates, new review articles, and fresh industry coverage can shift which brands get recommended from one month to the next."
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "What do I get in the initial brand snapshot?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "You get a clear baseline showing your AI citation share, average answer position, top competing brands appearing in your category prompts, and the third-party sources driving those answers."
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "How does recurring monthly tracking work?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "Once you review your initial snapshot, you can opt into a recurring monthly benchmark. We re-run your core category prompts every month so you can see whether your visibility is climbing or slipping."
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    </script>

    <style>
      :root {
        --bg: #ffffff;
        --subtle: #fafafa;
        --border: #e5e7eb;
        --border-light: #f3f4f6;
        --text: #111827;
        --muted: #6b7280;
        --dark: #111827;
        --dark-hover: #1f2937;
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      html {
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
      }

      body {
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Inter", "Segoe UI",
          Roboto, sans-serif;
        background: var(--bg);
        color: var(--text);
        line-height: 1.6;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      }

      a {
        color: inherit;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 1020px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 24px;
      }

      /* 1. Navbar */
      header {
        position: sticky;
        top: 0;
        z-index: 50;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.94);
        backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
      }

      .nav {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        height: 64px;
      }

      .logo {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 9px;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      }

      .logo-mark {
        width: 26px;
        height: 26px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        background: var(--dark);
        color: #fff;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      .nav-center {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 28px;
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-weight: 500;
      }

      .nav-center a:hover {
        color: var(--text);
      }

      .nav-actions {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
      }

      .btn-outline {
        padding: 7px 14px;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 7px;
        font-size: 0.84rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        color: var(--text);
        background: #fff;
      }

      .btn-outline:hover {
        background: var(--subtle);
      }

      .btn-dark {
        padding: 7px 15px;
        border-radius: 7px;
        font-size: 0.84rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #fff;
        background: var(--dark);
      }

      .btn-dark:hover {
        background: var(--dark-hover);
      }

      /* 2. Centered Hero */
      .hero {
        padding: 80px 0 64px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 4.5vw, 3rem);
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.035em;
        line-height: 1.15;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
        color: var(--text);
      }

      .hero-sub {
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        max-width: 580px;
        margin: 0 auto 36px;
      }

      /* Sleek Centered Form Bar */
      .hero-form-wrap {
        max-width: 680px;
        margin: 0 auto 28px;
        background: #ffffff;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 14px;
        padding: 18px;
        box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
        text-align: left;
      }

      .form-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .form-grid input {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 11px 14px;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        color: var(--text);
        background: #fff;
        transition: border-color 0.15s ease;
      }

      .form-grid input::placeholder {
        color: #9ca3af;
      }

      .form-grid input:focus {
        outline: none;
        border-color: var(--dark);
      }

      .form-submit-row {
        grid-column: 1 / -1;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        margin-top: 4px;
      }

      .form-hint {
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .btn-submit {
        padding: 11px 22px;
        background: var(--dark);
        color: #fff;
        border: none;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        cursor: pointer;
        white-space: nowrap;
        transition: background 0.15s ease;
      }

      .btn-submit:hover {
        background: var(--dark-hover);
      }

      .btn-submit:disabled {
        opacity: 0.6;
        cursor: not-allowed;
      }

      .status-box {
        display: none;
        text-align: center;
        padding: 16px 8px;
      }

      .status-box strong {
        display: block;
        font-size: 1rem;
        margin-bottom: 4px;
      }

      .status-box p {
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .error-msg {
        display: none;
        color: #dc2626;
        font-size: 0.82rem;
        grid-column: 1 / -1;
      }

      /* Inline Engine Strip */
      .engine-strip {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px 20px;
        font-size: 0.84rem;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .engine-strip span.engine-item {
        color: var(--text);
        font-weight: 500;
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 6px;
      }

      .dot {
        width: 6px;
        height: 6px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--dark);
        display: inline-block;
      }

      /* Shared Section Rhythm */
      section.block {
        padding: 68px 0;
      }

      .section-title {
        font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 1.9rem);
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.03em;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
      }

      .section-sub {
        font-size: 0.96rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        max-width: 600px;
        margin-bottom: 36px;
      }

      /* 3. Per-Engine Cards (3-col + 4th full or 2x2 / 4-col) */
      .grid-3 {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
        gap: 18px;
      }

      .grid-4 {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
        gap: 18px;
      }

      .flat-card {
        background: #fff;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 24px;
        transition: border-color 0.15s ease;
      }

      .flat-card:hover {
        border-color: #9ca3af;
      }

      .card-top {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }

      .icon-badge {
        width: 30px;
        height: 30px;
        border-radius: 7px;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--text);
      }

      .arrow {
        color: #9ca3af;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }

      .flat-card h3 {
        font-size: 0.98rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
      }

      .flat-card p {
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        line-height: 1.55;
      }

      /* 4. How It Works (Minimal Step Numbers) */
      .step-box {
        padding: 4px 0;
      }

      .step-num {
        display: inline-block;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: var(--muted);
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 6px;
        padding: 2px 8px;
        margin-bottom: 14px;
      }

      .step-box h3 {
        font-size: 0.96rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 6px;
      }

      .step-box p {
        font-size: 0.87rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        line-height: 1.55;
      }

      /* 5. FAQ Divider Accordion */
      .faq-list {
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      }

      details {
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        padding: 20px 0;
      }

      summary {
        font-size: 0.96rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        cursor: pointer;
        list-style: none;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        color: var(--text);
      }

      summary::-webkit-details-marker {
        display: none;
      }

      summary::after {
        content: "+";
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-weight: 400;
      }

      details[open] summary::after {
        content: "−";
      }

      details p {
        margin-top: 12px;
        font-size: 0.92rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        max-width: 780px;
      }

      /* 6. Dark Bottom CTA Card */
      .dark-cta {
        background: #111827;
        color: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 16px;
        padding: 56px 32px;
        text-align: center;
        margin: 24px 0 48px;
      }

      .dark-cta h2 {
        font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.03em;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }

      .dark-cta p {
        color: #9ca3af;
        max-width: 520px;
        margin: 0 auto 28px;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
      }

      .btn-white {
        display: inline-block;
        background: #ffffff;
        color: #111827;
        padding: 11px 22px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .btn-white:hover {
        background: #f3f4f6;
      }

      /* 7. Minimal 4-Column Footer */
      footer {
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border-light);
        padding: 56px 0 36px;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .footer-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
        gap: 32px;
        margin-bottom: 44px;
      }

      .footer-col h4 {
        color: var(--text);
        font-size: 0.84rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }

      .footer-col ul {
        list-style: none;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 8px;
      }

      .footer-col a:hover {
        color: var(--text);
      }

      .footer-bottom {
        text-align: center;
        padding-top: 24px;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border-light);
        font-size: 0.82rem;
      }

      @media (max-width: 820px) {
        .nav-center {
          display: none;
        }
        .grid-3,
        .grid-4 {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
        .form-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
        .form-submit-row {
          flex-direction: column;
          align-items: stretch;
        }
        .footer-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <!-- 1. Navbar -->
    <header>
      <div class="container nav">
        <a href="/" class="logo">
          <span class="logo-mark">G</span>
          GeoMetrics
        </a>

        <nav class="nav-center">
          <a href="#platforms">Platforms</a>
          <a href="#how-it-works">How It Works</a>
          <a href="#metrics">Metrics</a>
          <a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
          <a href="/blog">Blog</a>
        </nav>

        <div class="nav-actions">
          <a href="/blog" class="btn-outline">Blog</a>
          <a href="#request" class="btn-dark">Check Your Brand</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="container">
      <!-- 2. Centered Hero -->
      <section class="hero" id="request">
        <h1>Know where your brand stands in AI search.</h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">
          Track your brand's visibility across ChatGPT, Perplexity, Claude,
          Gemini &amp; Google AI Overviews. Pure measurement—no agency pitch.
        </p>

        <!-- Compact Centered Form -->
        <div class="hero-form-wrap">
          <form
            id="waitlist-form"
            class="form-grid"
            action="https://formspree.io/f/xyewbbne"
            method="POST"
          >
            <input
              type="text"
              name="brand"
              placeholder="Brand or website (e.g. yourbrand.com)"
              required
            />
            <input
              type="text"
              name="product"
              placeholder="Product / category (e.g. CRM Software)"
              required
            />
            <input
              type="email"
              name="email"
              placeholder="Work email (you@company.com)"
              required
            />
            <input
              type="tel"
              name="phone"
              placeholder="Phone / WhatsApp (Optional)"
            />

            <div class="form-submit-row">
              <span class="form-hint">
                Leave your details—we'll add you to the waitlist and get back to
                you.
              </span>
              <button type="submit" id="submit-btn" class="btn-submit">
                Join Waitlist →
              </button>
            </div>

            <p class="error-msg" id="error-msg">
              Something went wrong. Please try again.
            </p>
          </form>

          <div class="status-box" id="status-box">
            <strong>You're on the waitlist.</strong>
            <p>We've received your details and will get back to you soon.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Inline Engine Strip -->
        <div class="engine-strip">
          <span>Benchmarked across</span>
          <span class="engine-item"><span class="dot"></span> ChatGPT</span>
          <span class="engine-item"><span class="dot"></span> Perplexity</span>
          <span class="engine-item"><span class="dot"></span> Claude</span>
          <span class="engine-item"><span class="dot"></span> Gemini</span>
          <span class="engine-item"><span class="dot"></span> AI Overviews</span>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 3. Per-Engine Breakdown -->
      <section class="block" id="platforms">
        <h2 class="section-title">Visibility measured by AI platform.</h2>
        <p class="section-sub">
          Each model pulls from different sources and recommends different
          brands. We break your performance down engine by engine.
        </p>

        <div class="grid-3">
          <div class="flat-card">
            <div class="card-top">
              <span class="icon-badge">GPT</span>
              <span class="arrow">↗</span>
            </div>
            <h3>ChatGPT Visibility</h3>
            <p>
              See how often ChatGPT mentions your brand in buying prompts, how
              it describes you, and which competitors rank ahead.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="flat-card">
            <div class="card-top">
              <span class="icon-badge">PPX</span>
              <span class="arrow">↗</span>
            </div>
            <h3>Perplexity Citations</h3>
            <p>
              Check which brands Perplexity recommends and the exact third-party
              sources it cites in your category.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="flat-card">
            <div class="card-top">
              <span class="icon-badge">AI</span>
              <span class="arrow">↗</span>
            </div>
            <h3>Claude, Gemini &amp; AI Overviews</h3>
            <p>
              Measure your presence in head-to-head comparisons on Claude and
              inside Google's AI-generated summaries.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 4. How It Works (4 Steps) -->
      <section class="block" id="how-it-works">
        <h2 class="section-title">How it works.</h2>
        <p class="section-sub">
          No dashboards to configure or tracking scripts to install. Four simple
          steps to your baseline.
        </p>

        <div class="grid-4">
          <div class="step-box">
            <span class="step-num">01</span>
            <h3>Share your brand</h3>
            <p>
              Enter your website and core product category in the form above.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="step-box">
            <span class="step-num">02</span>
            <h3>We query AI engines</h3>
            <p>
              Real buyer prompts are tested across ChatGPT, Perplexity, Claude,
              Gemini, and AI Overviews.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="step-box">
            <span class="step-num">03</span>
            <h3>We analyze responses</h3>
            <p>
              Every answer is parsed for brand mentions, rank position,
              competing brands, and cited domains.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="step-box">
            <span class="step-num">04</span>
            <h3>Get your baseline</h3>
            <p>
              Receive a clean, readable snapshot showing where your brand stands
              today.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 5. 6-Card Metrics Grid -->
      <section class="block" id="metrics">
        <h2 class="section-title">What's inside a GeoMetrics benchmark.</h2>
        <p class="section-sub">
          Six core KPIs built for teams who want ground-truth AI visibility data
          before spending on optimization.
        </p>

        <div class="grid-3">
          <div class="flat-card">
            <h3>AI Citation Share</h3>
            <p>
              The percentage of high-intent category prompts where AI models
              explicitly mention or recommend your brand.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="flat-card">
            <h3>Answer Positioning</h3>
            <p>
              Whether you show up as the #1 recommendation, buried at the bottom
              of a list, or left out completely.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="flat-card">
            <h3>Competitor Share of Voice</h3>
            <p>
              A side-by-side breakdown of which competitors are capturing AI
              recommendations in your category.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="flat-card">
            <h3>Cited Source Audit</h3>
            <p>
              The exact third-party articles, review sites, and domains that AI
              engines rely on to form their answers.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="flat-card">
            <h3>Category Prompt Coverage</h3>
            <p>
              Performance across discovery, comparison, and "best of" prompts
              that buyers actually type into AI tools.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="flat-card">
            <h3>Monthly Visibility Drift</h3>
            <p>
              Optional recurring tracking to see how model updates and market
              changes move your visibility month over month.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 6. FAQ Divider Section -->
      <section class="block" id="faq">
        <h2 class="section-title">Frequently asked questions.</h2>
        <p class="section-sub">
          Straight answers on how AI visibility benchmarking works.
        </p>

        <div class="faq-list">
          <details open>
            <summary>How is AI visibility tracking different from Google SEO?</summary>
            <p>
              Google shows a fixed list of 10 blue links. AI engines write a
              fresh answer every time, weaving brand names into conversational
              recommendations. AI visibility tracking measures whether you get
              mentioned at all, how consistently you appear, and where you rank
              against competitors inside those answers.
            </p>
          </details>

          <details>
            <summary>Which AI engines does GeoMetrics benchmark?</summary>
            <p>
              We track brand visibility across ChatGPT, Perplexity, Claude,
              Google Gemini, and Google AI Overviews.
            </p>
          </details>

          <details>
            <summary>Do you also sell GEO or SEO optimization services?</summary>
            <p>
              No. GeoMetrics is strictly an independent measurement service. We
              give you accurate ground-truth numbers on where your brand stands
              without trying to upsell agency retainers.
            </p>
          </details>

          <details>
            <summary>How often do AI search answers change?</summary>
            <p>
              Much faster than traditional search. Model updates, new review
              articles, and fresh industry coverage can shift which brands get
              recommended from one month to the next.
            </p>
          </details>

          <details>
            <summary>What do I get in the initial brand snapshot?</summary>
            <p>
              You get a clear baseline showing your AI citation share, average
              answer position, top competing brands appearing in your category
              prompts, and the third-party sources driving those answers.
            </p>
          </details>

          <details>
            <summary>How does recurring monthly tracking work?</summary>
            <p>
              Once you review your initial snapshot, you can opt into a
              recurring monthly benchmark. We re-run your core category prompts
              every month so you can see whether your visibility is climbing or
              slipping.
            </p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 7. Dark Bottom CTA Banner -->
      <section class="dark-cta">
        <h2>AI answers shift every week. Track the trend.</h2>
        <p>
